      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "NVIDIA and Hugging Face are collaborating to bring the NVIDIA Isaac GR00T 1.7 open, reasoning vision language action (VLA) model for humanoid robots and the NVIDIA Isaac Teleop framework to LeRobot — Hugging Face’s open source library for robotics — with NVIDIA Cosmos 3 , a frontier model for physical AI, planned soon. Together, these integrations give developers a more accessible and standardized path for end-to-end robot development while driving innovation and collaboration across the open robotics community.",
